 "cowboystatedaily.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATV86aTcD.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://cowboystatedaily.com/2026/08/28/woman-flips-off-weston-county-deputy-at-112-mph-then-tells-cops-to-shoot-me/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "PSYCHO BITCH ON HER WAY TO THE LINDSAY CLANCY TRIAL....", "last_comment_created": 1788386573461, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 4, "score_up": 32, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "A South Dakota woman who gave a Weston County deputy on a traffic stop the finger while blowing by him at 112 mph faces the potential of more than 50\u2026", "large_image": "9uTQZ3s1QhA8JZWR.png", "title": "Woman Flips Off Weston County Deputy At 112 MPH, Then Tells Cops To \u2018Shoot Me\u2019"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATV86bZXs", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 18, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8813848, "raw_content": "I'm serious.  Aren't we in an existential fight with the forces of darkness, primarily communism/socialism, and with Islamism? Both of which are using each other to defeat Westernism, which is at heart Christendom.  The historic superiority of Western ideals is what has given us the luxuries and benefits of the modern world - and let's save the discussion about how it's not all good, because of course it isn't, but it's still better than anything else.\n\nThe left and Islam is in direct opposition to it, and has explicitly and implicitly told us that they want us all to die, or live our lives in slavery.  \n\nI'm not advocating that we should just start shooting commies and Muslims, but I think we're getting to the point that it will become a viable option and/or necessity.", "author": "Nomansapeninsula", "created": 1788381085926, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "LokeyLewd", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Real question re communism/Islamism - is it wrong to kill them?", "last_comment_created": 1788387414674, "content": "<p>I'm serious.  Aren't we in an existential fight with the forces of darkness, primarily communism/socialism, and with Islamism? Both of which are using each other to defeat Westernism, which is at heart Christendom.  The historic superiority of Western ideals is what has given us the luxuries and benefits of the modern world - and let's save the discussion about how it's not all good, because of course it isn't, but it's still better than anything else.</p>\n<p>The left and Islam is in direct opposition to it, and has explicitly and implicitly told us that they want us all to die, or live our lives in slavery.</p>\n<p>I'm not advocating that we should just start shooting commies and Muslims, but I think we're getting to the point that it will become a viable option and/or necessity.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 18, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2095171402194153561", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATV86b1Vt", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": fa